# --- Authentication ---------------------------------------------------------
# The Copilot SDK/CLI authenticates with your GitHub identity — NOT an LLM API key.
#
# Local development (recommended): run `copilot login` once (OAuth device flow,
# supports org SAML SSO) and you can leave the variable below empty.
#
# Non-interactive / CI: provide a GitHub token. Checked in this order by the SDK:
#   COPILOT_GITHUB_TOKEN > GH_TOKEN > GITHUB_TOKEN
# Use a fine-grained PAT with the "Copilot Requests" account permission
# (SSO-authorized for your org), or the built-in GITHUB_TOKEN inside GitHub
# Actions with `permissions: copilot-requests: write`.
COPILOT_GITHUB_TOKEN=

# --- Optional ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Model to use. "auto" lets Copilot pick an org-allowed model. Examples: gpt-5.4
COPILOT_MODEL=auto
